  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): カモガヤ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AB%E3%83%A2%E3%82%AC%E3%83%A4",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 108168278,
      "text": "カモガヤ はイネ科カモガヤ属の多年草。英名のオーチャードグラスでも流通する。和名のカモガヤ（鴨茅）は、英名の cock's-foot grass を訳すときに cock（ニワトリ）を duck（カモ）と間違えたといわれる。キヌイトソウ（絹糸草）ともいう。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Dactylis glomerata",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dactylis_glomerata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1367275754,
      "text": "Dactylis glomerata is a species of flowering plant in the grass family Poaceae, commonly known as barnyard grass, cocksfoot grass, cockspur, orchard grass, or cat grass (due to its popularity for use with domestic cats). It is a cool-season perennial C3 tufted grass native throughout most of Europe, temperate Asia, and northern Africa."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Dactylis glomerata",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dactylis_glomerata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171671755,
      "text": "Dactylis glomerata es una gramínea perenne, nativa de Europa y con importancia como planta forrajera."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Dactyle pelotonné",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dactyle_pelotonn%C3%A9",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 233843354,
      "text": "Dactylis glomerata, le dactyle aggloméré ou dactyle pelotonné, est une espèce de plantes monocotylédones, de la famille des Poaceae (graminées), sous-famille des Pooideae, originaire de l'Ancien Monde."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Dactylis glomerata",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dactylis_glomerata",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 70948729,
      "text": "Dactylis glomerata é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Poaceae. Junto com Agrostis capillaris, é uma das duas espécies a que se dá o nome vulgar panasco."
    }
  },
